  abstract = {Segment Anything Model 2 extends promptable segmentation to videos, but its streaming memory and transformer modules make deployment costly and uniform low-bit post-training quantization fragile. We show that quantization sensitivity is highly non-uniform, propose Greedy Layer-wise Sensitivity-guided Mixed-Precision Quantization, and combine it with memory-aware KV compression to improve the accuracy-efficiency trade-off.},
